      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Need profile notes to be unlimited, its sickening that there's a 2000 cap.  Thats like limiting everyone else on how may ppl they can meet or friend.  For me its screws up my age verify process for group instances.  now im gonna have to continue to bug the same ppl for their ages cause im already at the 2000 cap.",
