  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-10-18T15:08:38.009Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "There have been several requests for something similar, but they haven't addressed the simple use of VRC's newly created Content Gating.\n\nWith the advent of the Group Public instance, many groups such as our own 'VR Fam' do our best to keep our instances 18+.  There is no NSFW activity in our instances, we just want adults to interact with other adults free from the Pen Runners, Loud Screaming and other juvenile behavior which can easily be found elsewhere.  \n\nSuggestion is to simply allow the Instance Creator to Tag an Instance as 18+ utilizing the same functionality as Content Gating is for World and Avatar creation.\n\nUp Vote if you think this is a good idea for VRC to address",
